  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Note that&nbsp;<math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is a tangent to <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math> at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>e</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/3456789arbsrtygj.JPG\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 131px;\" /><br />Required Area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>e</mi></msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>e</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mi>e</mi></msubsup></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;sq. units</p>",
